Keep a shared word as empty text.
Place "aab" into word.
Keep a shared path as an empty list of text.
Keep a shared answers as an empty list of text.
Keep a shared pal as 0.
Set pal to 1.
To test from left (a whole number) with right (a whole number).
If left is at least right, return.
If character left of word is not character right of word, set pal to 0, return.
Test from left plus 1 with right minus 1.

To store answer.
The line is join path with ",".
Place line into answers.

To extend from start (a whole number) with finish (a whole number).
The piece is the slice of word from start to finish plus 1.
Place piece into path.
If finish is 2, store answer.
If finish is less than 2, scan from finish plus 1 with finish plus 1.
Remove the last item from path.

To scan from start (a whole number) with finish (a whole number).
If finish is more than 2, return.
Set pal to 1.
Test from start with finish.
If pal is 1, extend from start with finish.
Scan from start with finish plus 1.

Scan from 0 with 0.
For each answer in answers, show answer.
